---
// Hero.astro
---

<section class="relative pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-40 lg:pb-28 overflow-hidden bg-bg-main">
  <!-- Dynamic Background elements -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-primary/10 blur-3xl opacity-60"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 -left-24 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-bg-alt mix-blend-multiply blur-3xl opacity-50"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('https://grainy-gradients.vercel.app/noise.svg')] opacity-20 mix-blend-overlay"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold text-sm mb-6 animate-fade-in-up">
        <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
          <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-primary opacity-75"></span>
          <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-primary"></span>
        </span>
        La forma más fácil de vender
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-black text-secondary tracking-tight mb-8 leading-tight animate-fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 100ms;">
        Controla tu negocio de forma <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-orange-400">simple y rápida</span>
      </h1>
      
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-secondary/70 mb-10 leading-relaxed font-medium animate-fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 200ms;">
        El sistema integral en la nube para gestionar ventas, inventarios y administración. Diseñado para comercio general y restaurantes con facturación electrónica (SAT) y operación multi-sucursal.
      </p>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center items-center gap-4 animate-fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 300ms;">
        <a href="#precios" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 text-white rounded-full font-bold text-lg transition-transform transform hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-lg shadow-primary/30 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
          Comenzar ahora
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"></path></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="#como-funciona" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-bg-alt hover:bg-gray-300 text-secondary rounded-full font-bold text-lg transition-colors flex items-center justify-center">
          Saber más
        </a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-8 text-sm text-secondary/60 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium animate-fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 400ms;">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
        Prueba gratis por 14 días. Sin tarjeta de crédito.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Dashboard Mockup Image -->
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 mt-16 relative z-10 animate-fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 500ms;">
    <div class="relative rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-2xl overflow-hidden border border-bg-alt transform transition-transform hover:scale-[1.01] duration-500">
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-10 bg-bg-alt/50 flex items-center px-4 gap-2 border-b border-bg-alt">
        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-400"></div>
        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-400"></div>
        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-400"></div>
      </div>
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556742049-0cfed4f6a45d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80" alt="POS Dashboard Interface" class="w-full h-auto object-cover opacity-90 pt-10" />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-white/20 to-transparent pt-10"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @keyframes fadeInUp {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
  .animate-fade-in-up {
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out forwards;
  }
</style>
